<!--
    The icons, as path data.

    Fluent UI System Icons, the "Regular 20" set (the filled 20 for play and stop, because a
    transport button is a solid mark), pasted as geometry rather than pulled in as a library: this
    app draws about twenty icons and an SVG package would be a dependency, a licence and a renderer
    for that. Every entry is on the same 20 grid, so one `PathIcon` size fits all of them, and every
    one inherits `Foreground` — never name a colour here.

    MIT, Microsoft Corporation. The notice is in `Assets/Icons/LICENSE.txt`.
-->
